  "known_limitations": [
    "Painting is the independent unit; cases, candidates, mask variants, seeds, regions, and metrics are repeated or nested observations.",
    "The balanced 50-painting canonical population supports category analysis, but incomplete style metadata does not support a general independent style effect.",
    "Damage-size, robustness, and synthetic-degradation experiments contain one painting per category and support painting-specific rather than independent category effects.",
    "The repository contains only the controlled_50 dataset source, so a between-dataset comparison is not applicable.",
    "Generative uncertainty is available only for 130 canonical prompt-specific groups and 35 damage-size groups.",
    "Prompt variants remain separate uncertainty populations and cannot be pooled as repeated seeds.",
    "Mask-placement robustness and prompt sensitivity are not generative uncertainty.",
    "The ten-case SDXL population is bounded, incomplete, and descriptive only.",
    "General-purpose computational metrics do not establish historical authenticity, conservation suitability, or museum approval.",
    "Runtime depends on recorded hardware, software, batching, caching, and system load and remains separate from restoration quality."
